        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute the Directly-Follows Multigraph (DFMG) for a given object type within a process model. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads the process model, iterates all edges, and accumulates arcs with their frequency. Runs in O(n) over the edge list.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>model_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Process model identifier. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>object_type</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Object type (collection name) to trace. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>JSON: <programlisting filename=".json"><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;object_type&quot;:<sp/>&quot;documents&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;nodes&quot;:<sp/>[&quot;node-A&quot;,<sp/>&quot;node-B&quot;,<sp/>...],</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;arcs&quot;:<sp/>[{&quot;from&quot;:<sp/>&quot;node-A&quot;,<sp/>&quot;to&quot;:<sp/>&quot;node-B&quot;,<sp/>&quot;frequency&quot;:<sp/>3},<sp/>...]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>Obj type str. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">object_type</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
