    <briefdescription>
<para>Object-Centric Process Mining façade. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides three core capabilities:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para><bold><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_object_centric_tracer_1a07f7d1fee741e8348b7e908f0c179b56" kindref="member">buildOcelLog()</ref></bold> — Convert process instance attachments into an OCEL 2.0 compatible JSON event log.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_object_centric_tracer_1a498751c438a84e2ca441914066e28919" kindref="member">computeDfmg()</ref></bold> — Build the Directly-Follows Multigraph (DFMG) for a given object type across a process model.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_object_centric_tracer_1a328f437de3e26ed5099fe8a4132c1f05" kindref="member">analyze()</ref></bold> — Identify convergence (many→one) and divergence (one→many) nodes by object type.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Performance</title><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_object_centric_tracer_1a498751c438a84e2ca441914066e28919" kindref="member">computeDfmg()</ref></computeroutput> must handle 10,000 events in &lt; 5 s (O(n) frequency map).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_linker" kindref="compound">ProcessLinker</ref>, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_model_manager" kindref="compound">ProcessModelManager</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
